# Simple Web Stack

## Infrastructure Diagram

https://github.com/ixhadeel/holbertonschool-system_engineering-devops/blob/main/web_infrastructure_design/0-simple_web_stack.png

## Components

- Domain: foobar.com
- DNS: A record for www.foobar.com pointing to 8.8.8.8
- Server: One server hosting the website
- Web Server: Nginx handles HTTP requests
- Application Server: Executes application logic
- Application Files: Contains the application code
- Database: MySQL stores application data
- Communication: HTTP over TCP/IP

## Infrastructure Issues

- Single Point of Failure (SPOF): If the server fails, the website becomes unavailable.
- Downtime: Maintenance or deployment may interrupt the website.
- Scalability: One server may not handle high traffic.
